id: coup-de-grace-strike
name: Coup de Grace
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# Coup de Grace (2)'s, open while it applies; 2 Overwhelm its price (`stacksCost` - use-maneuver.mjs), paid as it is used.
special: true
stacksCost: overwhelm 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A (2 stacks of Overwhelm)
  –Effect: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# The Basic Attack out of sequence, made through this Maneuver (Unending Pressure (3) reads it - chat.mjs basicStrike).
[on used]
basicStrikeThrough();
